flowchart TB
    U[Manual kickoff] --> R[Workflow runtime]
    A[Schedule or Watchtower] --> W[Automation worktrees]
    W --> R
    C[Profiles, strategies and runtime limits] --> R
    R --> P[Coordinator]
    P --> D{Delegate within limits}
    D --> S1[Specialist A\nProvider, model, reasoning]
    D --> S2[Specialist B\nDifferent provider or reasoning]
    S2 --> S3[Optional nested specialist]
    S3 --> S2R[Specialist synthesis]
    S1 --> H[Bounded handoffs]
    S2R --> H
    H --> PS[Coordinator synthesis]
    PS --> RV[Independent review or debate]
    RV --> F[Repair and verification step]
    F --> HD{Human decision}
    HD -->|Accept and resume| DONE[Completed run]
    HD -->|Reject| BLOCKED[Failed run with decision history]
    R -. records .-> E[Graph changes, attempts, threads and events]
    S1 -. records .-> E
    S2 -. records .-> E
    HD -. records .-> E
